# During bootstrap, all TypeAssert checks pass because values carry unknown_type_val().
# [@Int 42] returns 42 (an Integer) — the assertion passes since the unknown sentinel
# is consistent with every type. See S-1001, sprint-reviewer finding #2.
# Enforcement (type mismatch detection) is deferred to S-1004 when repr_registry is wired.
[@Int 42]
=== out
Int(42)
